3:BRUSSELS, Oct. 2 (Xinhua) -- European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen on Friday welcomed a decision by the Group of Seven (G7) countries not to impose export bans on allies, and voiced support for an International Energy Agency (IEA)-coordinated release of fuel stocks.
4:"Our citizens need and deserve affordable energy," von der Leyen said in a social media X post following a virtual meeting of G7 leaders earlier in the day.
